WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
EPA 608 is not optional. You cannot legally touch refrigerant without it. Let's
make sure you pass.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Recovery removes refrigerant from a system into an approved cylinder. Recycling
cleans recovered refrigerant by removing oil and moisture for reuse. Reclamation
processes refrigerant at a certified facility to ARI 700 purity standards.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Recovery: Removing refrigerant from a system into an approved cylinder.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Recycling: Cleaning recovered refrigerant by removing oil and moisture.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Reclamation: Processing refrigerant to ARI 700 purity at a certified facility.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Here's why this matters on the job: You will recover refrigerant on almost every
major repair. Proper technique prevents contamination and legal issues.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Watch out for these: Never fill recovery cylinders above 80 percent. And —
Recovery equipment must be certified

00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
